{
  "_": [
    "The ONE mapping from source connector codes to our connector standard (wedrive-charging/1).",
    "ocm: OCM ConnectionTypeID -> standard. Every id OCM's /v3/referencedata lists is here, mapped",
    "to OTHER when we have no better name; an id missing from this table maps to OTHER and is",
    "counted in the build report, so a new OCM type is seen rather than silently lost.",
    "osm: the <type> of an OSM socket:<type>=<count> tag -> standard; same rule for unknown keys.",
    "ocm_current: OCM CurrentTypeID -> current. dc_standards: standards that are DC by definition,",
    "so a connector without a CurrentTypeID still counts as DC."
  ],
